ME_Desatch behavior attribution

SpektraFilm Studio's ME deSatch density implementation is a Swift adaptation of the
cone-coordinate desaturation/density behavior in ME_Desatch.dctl from Moaz Elgabry's
DCTLs repository, revision 5e57387d486e82e416cf25bc8a95aad5e7f33c7a.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/MoazElgabry/DCTLs
